  "description": "Updated! \nResults of first real adventures into exploring Substance Painter.\n\nI\u2019ve only recently been exposed to the program, and after a few initial base studies, I decided to put together something a bit bigger with multiple pieces, various materials, colors and imprints, resulting in this Game Boy Advance project.\n\nI\u2019ve learnt much over the past weeks playing with it, and have come out stronger with many tricks to adapt future pipelines for as well.\n\nCurrently the model PC is 4529.\nHaving sorted out previous issues exporting from Substance, the model is now also properly using the 2048 maps as desired for this project.",
